### 21. GET /api/v1/shipments/{trackingNumber}/scans: 200, the history oldest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shipments/{{trackingNumber}}/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### 22. GET /api/v1/shipments/{trackingNumber}/scans: 404, unknown tracking number
