PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shipments/{{trackingNumber}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": 2 }

### 59. DELETE /api/v1/shipments/{trackingNumber}: 403, version 1 cannot bypass the Admin rule
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shipments/{{trackingNumber}}
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### 60. POST /api/v2/shipments: 403, creating a shipment needs the Admin role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "APX-00000013",
  "recipientName": "DEMO V2 Recipient",
  "recipientPhone": "+919876543210",
  "recipientAddress": "11 Demo Lane",
  "recipientCity": "Nagpur",
  "weightKg": 1.2
}

