### 62. GET /api/shipments: 200, the unversioned Part B URL is an alias of version 1 (Week 4 review)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments?pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### 63. GET /api/shipments/{trackingNumber}: 200, the version 1 shape and the version headers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shipments/{{trackingNumber}}
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### 64. GET /api/v2/shipments/{trackingNumber}: 200, latestScan.scanType is a name, such as "InTransit" (Week 4 review)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments/{{v2TrackingNumber}}
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
